Usage: netsimd [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -s, --fd-startup-str <FD_STARTUP_STR>
          File descriptor start up info proto
  -c, --connector-instance <CONNECTOR_INSTANCE>
          Enables connector mode to forward packets to another instance [aliases: --connector_instance_num]
  -i, --instance <INSTANCE>
          Netsimd instance number [aliases: --instance_num]
  -l, --logtostderr
          Set whether log messages go to stderr instead of logfiles
  -d, --dev
          Enable development mode. This will include additional features
      --no-cli-ui
          Disable grpc server for CLI
      --no-web-ui
          Disable web server No-op: no web UI is currently implemented
      --http-proxy <HTTP_PROXY>
          Redirect all TCP connections through the specified HTTP/HTTPS proxy.
          Can be one of the following:
              `http://<server>:<port>`
              `http://<username>:<password>@<server>:<port>`
              (the 'http://' prefix can be omitted) [env: http_proxy=]
      --no-shutdown
          Disable netsimd from shutting down automatically. WARNING: This flag is for development purpose. netsimd will not shutdown without SIGKILL
      --idle-shutdown-timeout <IDLE_SHUTDOWN_TIMEOUT>
          Set the idle shutdown timeout in milliseconds
      --startup-timeout <STARTUP_TIMEOUT>
          Set the startup timeout in milliseconds
      --pcap
          Enable packet capture
      --disable-address-reuse
          Disable Address Reuse for Bluetooth test model
  -v, --verbose
          Entering Verbose mode
      --version
          Print Netsimd version information
      --grpc-port <GRPC_PORT>
          gRPC port for the netsim service. Overrides env var NETSIM_GRPC_PORT
      --grpc-uds-path <GRPC_UDS_PATH>
          Unix Domain Socket path for the netsim gRPC service
      --hci-port <HCI_PORT>
          HCI port for the raw TCP socket. Overrides env var NETSIM_HCI_PORT
      --tcp-port <TCP_PORT>
          TCP port for the packet stream service. Overrides env var NETSIM_TCP_PORT
      --ws-port <WS_PORT>
          WebSocket port for the web UI. Overrides env var NETSIM_WS_PORT
      --host-dns <HOST_DNS>
          DNS server for the host TODO: Not implemented yet
      --forward-host-mdns
          Forward mDNS packets from host to guest Wi-Fi medium
      --test-beacons
          Start with test beacons
      --no-test-beacons
          Do not start with test beacons
  -h, --help
          Print help

WiFi Settings:
      --wifi-ssid <WIFI_SSID>
          Set the initial SSID for the default Access Point (defaults to 'AndroidWifi')
      --wifi-password <WIFI_PASSWORD>
          Set the WPA passphrase for the default Access Point (optional)
      --wifi-channel <WIFI_CHANNEL>
          Set the initial radio channel for the default Access Point (defaults to 11)
      --wifi-beacon-interval <WIFI_BEACON_INTERVAL>
          Set the beacon interval in TU for the default Access Point (defaults to 100)
      --wifi-mode <WIFI_MODE>
          Set the 802.11 mode for the default Access Point (defaults to "g") [possible values: a, b, g, n, ac, ax]
